# A stock MeshCore room server: opening it asks for the password and logs in
# (keep-alive started); our post is delivered; another member's post arrives
# with their name; after a reboot the saved password logs in by itself.
# both-modes
room Club 8 sesame
node Kim 7
link Kim Club 7
as Club advert
as Kim advert
wait 3000
key menu
key down 3
key enter
wait 2000
hold esc 900
as Kim login Club sesame
wait 4000
key right 2
type club
key enter
shot room-password
type sesame
key enter
wait 5000
expect request ok
shot room-logged-in
type Hello room
key enter
wait 6000
expect status delivered
as Kim dm Club Hi all, Kim here
wait 20000
shot room-post
dump
reboot
wait 3000
key right 2
type club
key enter
wait 6000
expect request ok
shot room-auto-login
